  post_level="1000.,975.,950.,925.,900.,875.,850.,825.,800.,775.,750.,725.,700.,675.,650.,625.,600.,575.,550.,525.,500.,475.,450.,425.,400.,375.,350.,325.,300.,275.,250.,225.,200.,175.,150.,125.,100." 
